      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/25-perchlike-fishes/25c-perchlike-fishes-3-remaining-cichlids-from-africa/_en-7/",
      "html": "<p>Few of them are available for the first time: Ptychochromis oligacanthus \"Bempazawa\". With their current size of about 15 cm, they have already reached sexual maturity. For cichlid lovers they are an interesting enrichment and guarantee a certain exclusiveness for their owner.</p>"
